      "text": "false churches shall deny the Holy Ghost, which gives utterance, 2 Ne. 28:4. the Spirit stops utterance of Nephi1, 2 Ne. 32:7. people of Benjamin cannot find utterance because of great joy, Mosiah 4:20. Korihor is struck dumb, that he cannot have utterance, Alma 30:49–50. voice speaks marvelous things, which cannot be uttered by man, Hel. 5:33. words of Jesus’ prayer cannot be uttered by man, 3 Ne. 19:34. Jesus looses children’s tongues that they can utter marvelous things, 3 Ne. 26:14, 16.",
